  title "The Corkscrew Unwound"
  summary "Two scarred orca hunters, Grul and Gork, infiltrate the corrupted cavern of Iasnolica to destroy fire-cores that power a deadly technique called Gut Inversion before the aurora crystals fully awaken and grant their enemies lethal power. They fight through penguin miners and confront the Augur, a shadow-steel wielding adversary, but Gork is fatally struck while reaching for the Thrumed Shadow-glass instead of completing the mission. Grul abandons the objective and escapes the collapsing cavern as it seals behind him, emerging alone and gravely wounded into the dark sea."
